    "kind": "REDEFINITION",
    "quote": "The ID is guaranteed inactive before START, but may be reused after stopping",
    "consequence": "Solution stores state per ID globally, merges independent activations with same reused ID",
    "guard": "Track each activation separately by ID, allow ID reuse only after previous activation stops"
